WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Have you ever wondered what's on our side of the fire wall?

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Possible living space for the people in our country.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Energy that you can afford again.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A country that does not lead the world's top in terms of eco-exports and energy taxes,

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:19.000
but in terms of technology openness and progress.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:24.000
A Germany that protects its citizens and not those who are not allowed to be here.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Quite simply, a Germany for you.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Time for Germany. Time for Alice Weidel.
